        rdfs:label "Goldbeter, Gonze & Pourquié (2007) / Baker, Schnell & Maini (2006) RA–FGF8/Wnt mutual cross-inhibition bistable determination wavefront in vertebrate somitogenesis, gated by a Lewis (2003) delayed Her1/Hes7 clock lattice on 2D bilateral paraxial mesoderm strips — Source and data traceability: 94/100" ;
        dcterms:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "`datasets/fgf_wnt_bistable_wavefront/` now vendors `fgf_wnt_clock_lr_reference.json` (Lewis 2003 parameters and period table, competence window, Vermot & Pourquié LR law and 4 regimes, bilateral geometry) with its SHA-256 pinned in `EXPECTED_SHA256` (L131-146) and verified at runtime (`verify_dataset_integrity`, L148-172); `paper_citations.bib` and `README.md` add Lewis 2003, Palmeirim 1997, Dubrulle 2001 and Vermot et al. 2005 Science (10 DOIs total). Where a constant is not published (Notch K_D, L452-453) or is fitted (b_LR = 0.727, L821, L839) the code says so. Deduction: b_LR, K_buf and h_buf remain calibrated constants without a cited molecular source." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-source-traceability> ;
